mprove input handling and ensure consistent state management.","tree":{"sha":"2305c5c2b9155cfe33470244243bc56021f2884f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlicanSuleymanoglu/ali-fs-app/git/trees/2305c5c2b9155cfe33470244243bc56021f2884f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlicanSuleymanoglu/ali-fs-app/git/commits/eb5057d89a2883b0d5655f95c44ddbb6804b42c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/AlicanSuleymanoglu/ali-fs-app/commit/eb5057d89a2883b0d5655f95c44ddbb6804b42c5","node_id":"C_kwDOPI4KydoAKGViNTA1N2Q4OWEyODgzYjBkNTY1NWY5NWM0NGRkYmI2ODA0YjQyYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlicanSuleymanoglu/ali-fs-app/commit/acf8b74ad08b6b50a3a2360ba428f2133c3792cf","sha":"acf8b74ad08b6b50a3a2360ba428f2133c3792cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlicanSuleymanoglu/ali-fs-app/commits/acf8b74ad08b6b50a3a2360ba428f2133c3792cf"}],"sha":"eb5057d89a2883b0d5655f95c44ddbb6804b42c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlicanSuleymanoglu/ali-fs-app/commits/eb5057d89a2883b0d5655f95c44ddbb6804b42c5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlicanSuleymanoglu/ali-fs-app/commits/acf8b74ad08b6b50a3a2360ba428f2133c3792cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-23T09:50:14Z","email":"paul@allo.restaurant","name":"Paul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-23T09:50:14Z","email":"paul@allo.restaurant","name":"Paul"},"message":"Enhance meeting details retrieval and UI components\n\n- Refactored the meeting details mapping to support multiple companies and deals, improving data structure for better handling.\n- Updated API calls to fetch associated deal details alongside company and contact details.\n- Modified UI components (CalendarView, MeetingCard, Dashboard, MeetingActions) to display multiple companies and deals, including popover functionality for better user interaction.\n- Adjusted state management in WeeklyOverview to streamline meeting data handling.\n- Improved type definitions in hooks and components to accommodate new data structures.","tree":{"sha":"3a708552668cfc0cb258bd022c206d7f65e8e2b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlicanSuleymanoglu/ali-fs-app/git/trees/3a708552668cfc0cb258bd022c206d7f65e8e2b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlicanSuleymanoglu/ali-fs-app/git/commits/acf8b74ad08b6b50a3a2360ba428f2133c3792cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/AlicanSuleymanoglu/ali-fs-app/commit/acf8b74ad08b6b50a3a2360ba428f2133c3792cf","node_id":"C_kwDOPI4KydoAKGFjZjhiNzRhZDA4YjZiNTBhM2EyMzYwYmE0MjhmMjEzM2MzNzkyY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlicanSuleymanoglu/ali-fs-app/commit/8b7660b07f2f0366559420e3ce1dabc5eebbce58","sha":"8b7660b07f2f0366559420e3ce1dabc5eebbce58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlicanSuleymanoglu/ali-fs-app/commits/8b7660b07f2f0366559420e3ce1dabc5eebbce58"}],"sha":"acf8b74ad08b6b50a3a2360ba428f2133c3792cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlicanSuleymanoglu/ali-fs-app/commits/acf8b74ad08b6b50a3a2360ba428f2133c3792cf"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlicanSuleymanoglu/ali-fs-app/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=5040989519a61071003bb23adb0b1abf4a72caa6&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A15%3A31.873Z"}');
