86881?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73","id":99886881,"login":"Neno73","node_id":"U_kgDOBfQnIQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/658b2044b88df4703ef35e0f638223acead4063b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-29T22:33:40Z","email":"nenad@sols.mk","name":"Nenad Zafirovski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-29T22:33:40Z","email":"nenad@sols.mk","name":"Nenad Zafirovski"},"message":"🔧 Fix ClaudeBot feedback from PRs #6, #7, #8 before Phase 3\n\nThis commit addresses ALL high and medium priority issues identified by ClaudeBot\nin the Phase 2 PRs before proceeding with Phase 3 (Worker implementation).\n\n## Critical Bug Fixes\n- Fix supplier.id reference in orchestration service (lines 147, 211)\n  * Ensure numeric ID conversion for database queries\n  * Strapi 5 uses documentId (string) but DB needs numeric ID\n- Migrate category import to Strapi 5 Document API (lines 262-278)\n  * Replace legacy strapi.db.query() with strapi.documents()\n  * Consistent API usage throughout application\n\n## Security & Validation Improvements\n- Add R2 environment variable validation (image-upload-service.ts)\n  * Validate all 5 required R2 credentials before client creation\n  * Prevent runtime crashes from missing credentials\n- Add Redis connection validation (queue-config.ts)\n  * Validate REDIS_URL exists and has correct format\n  * Check for redis:// or rediss:// protocol\n- Add input validation for supplierId parameter\n  * Validate non-empty string format\n  * Throw meaningful error for invalid IDs\n\n## Code Quality Improvements\n- Remove unused hash-service import from orchestration service\n- Fix job ID generation collision risk\n  * Add UUID to job IDs for guaranteed uniqueness\n  * Previous timestamp-only approach could collide in high-throughput\n- Replace ALL console.log with strapi.log across 11 service files\n  * console.log → strapi.log.info\n  * console.error → strapi.log.error\n  * console.warn → strapi.log.warn\n\n## Database Performance\n- Create migration for performance indexes\n  * products: a_number, sku, promidata_hash, supplier\n  * product_variants: sku, product, [product+color], [product+is_primary]\n  * Critical for production performance with large datasets\n\n## Documentation\n- Add CLAUDEBOT_FEEDBACK_REVIEW.md with all PR feedback consolidated\n- Add TESTING_STRATEGY.md with Jest setup and test patterns\n- Add migration file with up/down methods\n\n## Files Changed\nModified (13):\n- src/api/promidata-sync/services/promidata-sync.ts\n- src/services/queue/queue-config.ts\n- src/services/promidata/media/image-upload-service.ts\n- src/services/promidata/sync/variant-sync-service.ts\n- src/services/promidata/sync/product-sync-service.ts\n- src/services/promidata/transformers/*.ts (3 files)\n- src/services/promidata/parsers/*.ts (3 files)\n- src/services/promidata/api/promidata-client.ts\n- src/services/promidata/media/deduplication.ts\n\nAdded (3):\n- database/migrations/2025.10.29T00.00.00.add-sync-indexes.js\n- docs/CLAUDEBOT_FEEDBACK_REVIEW.md\n- docs/TESTING_STRATEGY.md\n\n## Testing\n✅ TypeScript build successful (npm run build)\n✅ All files compile without errors\n✅ Ready for Phase 3 worker implementation\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"def6c3f26fc1b6ebddb9ad25404bb25ec9699e7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/trees/def6c3f26fc1b6ebddb9ad25404bb25ec9699e7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/commits/658b2044b88df4703ef35e0f638223acead4063b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99886881?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73","id":99886881,"login":"Neno73","node_id":"U_kgDOBfQnIQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/658b2044b88df4703ef35e0f638223acead4063b","node_id":"C_kwDOPJPRqtoAKDY1OGIyMDQ0Yjg4ZGY0NzAzZWYzNWUwZjYzODIyM2FjZWFkNDA2M2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/596fe1b3168825228dd94b555ca5431bb722e6ff","sha":"596fe1b3168825228dd94b555ca5431bb722e6ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/596fe1b3168825228dd94b555ca5431bb722e6ff"}],"sha":"658b2044b88df4703ef35e0f638223acead4063b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/6