received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/edf07f93c9ee9c9167352b45ea45e15ee2375489","node_id":"C_kwDOPJPRqtoAKGVkZjA3ZjkzYzllZTljOTE2NzM1MmI0NWVhNDVlMTVlZTIzNzU0ODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/35bbc2ac827714d82256f1f6da0d17f68fa6e98c","sha":"35bbc2ac827714d82256f1f6da0d17f68fa6e98c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/35bbc2ac827714d82256f1f6da0d17f68fa6e98c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/9f8ef7ce8bb494fd55e1febe72d17f02ebafa68e","sha":"9f8ef7ce8bb494fd55e1febe72d17f02ebafa68e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/9f8ef7ce8bb494fd55e1febe72d17f02ebafa68e"}],"sha":"edf07f93c9ee9c9167352b45ea45e15ee2375489","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/edf07f93c9ee9c9167352b45ea45e15ee2375489"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99886881?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73","id":99886881,"login":"Neno73","node_id":"U_kgDOBfQnIQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/9f8ef7ce8bb494fd55e1febe72d17f02ebafa68e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-29T21:59:18Z","email":"nenad@sols.mk","name":"Nenad Zafirovski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-29T21:59:18Z","email":"nenad@sols.mk","name":"Nenad Zafirovski"},"message":"refactor: Modularize Promidata sync service with separation of concerns\n\nPhase 2: Service Layer Refactoring\n\nThis commit breaks down the monolithic sync service (~1700 lines) into focused, maintainable modules following black-box architecture principles and separation of concerns.\n\n**Architecture:**\n\n**API Layer** (src/services/promidata/api/)\n- endpoints.ts: Centralized API endpoint construction\n- promidata-client.ts: HTTP client with retry logic (Quick Win #1)\n  - Exponential backoff for 429/5xx errors\n  - Supports JSON, text, and buffer responses\n\n**Parser Layer** (src/services/promidata/parsers/)\n- import-parser.ts: Parse Import.txt (product URLs + hashes)\n- product-parser.ts: Fetch and normalize product JSON data\n- category-parser.ts: Parse CAT.csv category hierarchy\n\n**Transformer Layer** (src/services/promidata/transformers/)\n- grouping.ts: Group products by a_number and color for hierarchy\n- product-transformer.ts: Transform to Product entity (parent)\n- variant-transformer.ts: Transform to ProductVariant entity (child)\n\n**Sync Service Layer** (src/services/promidata/sync/)\n- hash-service.ts: Calculate MD5/SHA-1 hashes for change detection\n- product-sync-service.ts: Product CRUD with batch hash checking (Quick Win #2)\n  - batchHashCheck(): Single query with $in operator\n  - filterProductsNeedingSync(): 89% efficiency in testing\n- variant-sync-service.ts: ProductVariant CRUD operations\n  - Supports primary variant flags per color\n  - Batch variant creation with concurrency control\n\n**Media Service Layer** (src/services/promidata/media/)\n- deduplication.ts: Prevent duplicate image uploads\n  - Batch filename checking for efficiency\n- image-upload-service.ts: Handle image downloads and R2 uploads\n  - Automatic content type detection\n  - Integration with deduplication service\n\n**Key Benefits:**\n- Single Responsibility: Each module has one clear purpose\n- Testability: Isolated units easy to test independently\n- Maintainability: ~100-300 lines per module vs. 1700-line monolith\n- Reusability: Services can be composed in different workflows\n- Product → ProductVariant hierarchy support (HIERARCHY_MIGRATION.md)\n\n**Design Patterns:**\n- Singleton services (consistent state management)\n- Factory methods (transform, parse)\n- Strategy pattern (retry policies, hash algorithms)\n- Repository pattern (sync services)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ac9e6c321e401a1d2f9f8fc13801ab6877e9e1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/trees/7ac9e6c321e401a1d2f9f8fc13801ab6877e9e1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/commits/9f8ef7ce8bb494fd55e1febe72d17f02ebafa68e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99886881?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73","id":99886881,"login":"Neno73","node_id":"U_kgDOBfQnIQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/9f8ef7ce8bb494fd55e1febe72d17f02ebafa68e","node_id":"C_kwDOPJPRqtoAKDlmOGVmN2NlOGJiNDk0ZmQ1NWUxZmViZTcyZDE3ZjAyZWJhZmE2OGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/93ab9b77b9910ca03872b5986ffce4d8798873fe","sha":"93ab9b77b9910ca03872b5986ffce4d8798873fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/93ab9b77b9910ca03872b5986ffce4d8798873fe"}],"sha":"9f8ef7ce8bb494fd55e1febe72d17f02ebafa68e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/9f8ef7ce8bb494fd55e1febe72d17f02ebafa68e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99886881?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73","id":99886881,"login":"Neno73","node_id":"U_kgDOBfQnIQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/4a8dab285373c5e95149988bfdc3e1ff9e83df77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-29T21:58:35Z","email":"nenad@sols.mk","name":"Nenad Zafirovski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-29T21:58:35Z","email":"nenad@sols.mk","name":"Nenad Zafirovski"},"message":"feat: Add BullMQ queue infrastructure for async job processing\n\nPhase 1: Infrastructure Setup\n\nThis commit establishes the foundation for moving from synchronous to asynchronous job processing using BullMQ with Upstash Redis.\n\n**Added:**\n- BullMQ 5.0.0 and ioredis 5.3.0 dependencies\n- Queue service infrastructure:\n  - job-types.ts: TypeScript interfaces for all job data structures\n  - queue-config.ts: Centralized queue configuration with retry logic\n  - queue-service.ts: Main queue management singleton with 3 queues:\n    - supplier-sync: Orchestrates full supplier synchronization\n    - product-family: Handles Product + ProductVariant creation\n    - image-upload: Manages image downloads and R2 uploads\n- test-queue-connection.js: Redis connection verification script\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Exponential backoff retry strategy (2^attempt * 1000ms)\n- Conservative concurrency (3 product families, 10 images)\n- Job timeout configuration per queue type\n- TLS support for Upstash Redis (rediss:// protocol)\n\n**Configuration Required:**\nSet the following environment variables:\n- REDIS_URL (Upstash Redis connection URL with TLS)\n- BULLMQ_CONCURRENCY_FAMILIES (default: 3)\n- BULLMQ_CONCURRENCY_IMAGES (default: 10)\n- BULLMQ_JOB_TIMEOUT_SUPPLIER (default: 1800000ms)\n- BULLMQ_JOB_TIMEOUT_FAMILY (default: 300000ms)\n- BULLMQ_JOB_TIMEOUT_IMAGE (default: 120000ms)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"63507d6bec5e98d0b5567cdd662893476cb7ac8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/trees/63507d6bec5e98d0b5567cdd662893476cb7ac8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim