c18b3a469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/2a4a2d6354376b52fe5b9bd31cb1999c18b3a469"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99886881?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73","id":99886881,"login":"Neno73","node_id":"U_kgDOBfQnIQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/bc5644c962009dff82d443283269dc1d50e9951e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-29T20:43:13Z","email":"nenad@sols.mk","name":"Nenad Zafirovski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-29T20:43:13Z","email":"nenad@sols.mk","name":"Nenad Zafirovski"},"message":"✨ Add retry mechanism with exponential backoff to Promidata sync\n\nImplements robust error handling for Promidata API calls to handle transient failures, rate limiting, and server errors.\n\n**New Features:**\n- `fetchWithRetry()`: Smart retry mechanism with exponential backoff (up to 3 attempts)\n- `delay()`: Utility for controlled delays between retries\n\n**Error Handling:**\n- Rate limiting (429): Respects Retry-After header or uses exponential backoff\n- Server errors (5xx): Auto-retry with exponential delays (1s, 2s, 4s)\n- Network errors: Auto-retry with backoff\n- Client errors (4xx): Fail immediately without retry\n\n**Updated Endpoints:**\n- `fetchSuppliersFromPromidata()`: Now uses retry mechanism\n- `fetchCategoriesFromPromidata()`: Now uses retry mechanism\n- `parseProductUrlsWithHashes()`: Now uses retry mechanism\n\n**Benefits:**\n- Resilient to temporary API outages\n- Handles rate limiting gracefully\n- Reduces sync failures from transient network issues\n- Improves overall sync reliability\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"720eb8a64b3368194937d1805c67688141b91b70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/trees/720eb8a64b3368194937d1805c67688141b91b70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/commits/bc5644c962009dff82d443283269dc1d50e9951e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99886881?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73","id":99886881,"login":"Neno73","node_id":"U_kgDOBfQnIQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neno73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/bc5644c962009dff82d443283269dc1d50e9951e","node_id":"C_kwDOPJPRqtoAKGJjNTY0NGM5NjIwMDlkZmY4MmQ0NDMyODM