":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/4eb553fedebb31177978c21596a07f01a7a23dc5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/8467cf53b8aed724ef8cc8e9ce633e7e38ae3fcf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-27T19:41:36Z","email":"neno@promoatlas.com","name":"Neno PromoAtlas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-27T19:41:36Z","email":"neno@promoatlas.com","name":"Neno PromoAtlas"},"message":"🚨 URGENT: Remove exposed environment file containing database and API credentials\n\n- Removed backend/.env.development with exposed secrets\n- Database password rotation required\n- Cloudflare R2 keys need rotation\n- Strapi security keys need regeneration\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1cd7371df5f7b4e28cfddd82bf4f2a8899afa16a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/trees/1cd7371df5f7b4e28cfddd82bf4f2a8899afa16a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/commits/8467cf53b8aed724ef8cc8e9ce633e7e38ae3fcf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/8467cf53b8aed724ef8cc8e9ce633e7e38ae3fcf","node_id":"C_kwDOPJPRqtoAKDg0NjdjZjUzYjhhZWQ3MjRlZjhjYzhlOWNlNjMzZTdlMzhhZTNmY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/62dbf0e183d5c67f9ea375eeb96fdf3525866509","sha":"62dbf0e183d5c67f9ea375eeb96fdf3525866509","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/62dbf0e183d5c67f9ea375eeb96fdf3525866509"}],"sha":"8467cf53b8aed724ef8cc8e9ce633e7e38ae3fcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/8467cf53b8aed724ef8cc8e9ce633e7e38ae3fcf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/62dbf0e183d5c67f9ea375eeb96fdf3525866509/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-27T16:26:48Z","email":"neno@promoatlas.com","name":"Neno PromoAtlas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-27T16:26:48Z","email":"neno@promoatlas.com","name":"Neno PromoAtlas"},"message":"🚀 Complete Docker Deployment & Neon Database Recovery Setup\n\n## Major Changes Summary\n\n### 🐳 Docker Deployment Infrastructure\n- **Production-ready Dockerfiles** for both backend and frontend\n- **Multi-stage builds** with optimized production images\n- **Docker Compose** configurations for production deployment\n- **Nginx reverse proxy** setup for frontend serving\n- **Cloudflare R2 integration** for image storage\n- **Deployment scripts** for automated Hetzner Cloud deployment\n\n### 🛠️ Deployment Fixes & Troubleshooting\n- **Fixed Strapi 5 admin panel** path issues with symlinks\n- **Resolved JWT configuration** errors in production\n- **Fixed TypeScript compilation** for production builds\n- **Container orchestration** with proper environment variables\n- **Database connection** fixes for PostgreSQL/Neon integration\n\n### 💾 Database Recovery & Branch Strategy\n- **Recovered lost data** from Neon point-in-time restore (15:00 today)\n- **Established proper branching**:\n  - `production` branch for live data (Hetzner deployment)\n  - `development-active` branch for daily development work\n  - Backup branches for data protection\n- **Environment separation** with dedicated .env files\n- **Data protection strategy** to prevent future data loss\n\n### 📋 Backup & Recovery System\n- **Tiered backup strategy** with daily/weekly snapshots\n- **Automated backup rotation** script within 10-branch limit\n- **Clear recovery procedures** documented\n- **Branch management** best practices implemented\n\n### 📚 Documentation & Scripts\n- **Comprehensive deployment guides** (DEPLOYMENT.md, DEPLOYMENT_STATUS.md)\n- **Neon backup strategy** documentation (NEON_BACKUP_STRATEGY.md)\n- **Deployment automation scripts** for reproducible deployments\n- **Environment configuration** templates and examples\n\n### 🔧 Environment Configuration\n- **Multi-environment support**:\n  - `.env.development` → Neon development branch\n  - `.env.production` → Neon production branch\n  - Separate configurations for local/remote deployments\n- **Database branch isolation** for safe development\n- **Production data protection** with read-only access patterns\n\n## Infrastructure Impact\n- ✅ **Hetzner Cloud deployment** fully operational at 49.12.199.93:1337\n- ✅ **Data recovery** completed with 56 suppliers and 284 products restored\n- ✅ **Development isolation** established to prevent production data corruption\n- ✅ **Backup redundancy** implemented with automated rotation\n- ✅ **Production stability** ensured with proper environment separation\n\n## Critical Lessons Learned\n- Never work directly on production database branches\n- Always use development branches for testing and changes\n- Implement backup strategies before making infrastructure changes\n- Document recovery procedures for team knowledge sharing\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"182cbbf6d27b054504578650b2d459b88feb8259","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/trees/182cbbf6d27b054504578650b2d459b88feb8259"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/commits/62dbf0e183d5c67f9ea375eeb96fdf3525866509","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/62dbf0e183d5c67f9ea375eeb96fdf3525866509","node_id":"C_kwDOPJPRqtoAKDYyZGJmMGUxODNkNWM2N2Y5ZWEzNzVlZWI5NmZkZjM1MjU4NjY1MDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/305dbd4afd8846ce4bcd8702a615c8dacfa7b8a4","sha":"305dbd4afd8846ce4bcd8702a615c8dacfa7b8a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/305dbd4afd8846ce4bcd8702a615c8dacfa7b8a4"}],"sha":"62dbf0e183d5c67f9ea375eeb96fdf3525866509","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/62dbf0e183d5c67f9ea375eeb96fdf3525866509"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/305dbd4afd8846ce4bcd8702a615c8dacfa7b8a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-27T10:01:31Z","email":"neno@promoatlas.com","name":"Neno PromoAtlas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-27T10:04:24Z","email":"neno@promoatlas.com","name":"Neno PromoAtlas"},"message":"✨ Implement Hash-Based Incremental Sync & Fix Strapi 5 Compatibility\n\n🚀 Major Features:\n- Hash-based incremental sync for efficient product updates (89% efficiency achieved)\n- Complete Strapi 5 frontend compatibility with documentId routing\n- Enhanced admin dashboard with all 56 suppliers and sync efficiency metrics\n\n🔧 Critical Fixes:\n- Remove .attributes wrapper from frontend TypeScript interfaces\n- Update routing to use documentId instead of numeric id\n- Fix supplier sync pagination showing all suppliers\n- Correct CORS configuration removing deprecated options\n\n📊 Performance Improvements:\n- Skip unchanged products based on hash comparison\n- Real-time efficiency reporting (98/110 products skipped in A360 test)\n- Comprehensive sync logging and error tracking\n\n🧪 Verified with A360 supplier sync test showing 89% efficiency\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"422571c3b5cef79c36c240cad1f9c1bb70e27adf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/trees/422571c3b5cef79c36c240cad1f9c1bb70e27adf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/commits/305dbd4afd8846ce4bcd8702a615c8dacfa7b8a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":