d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-12T21:40:59Z","email":"neno@promoatlas.com","name":"Neno PromoAtlas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-12T21:40:59Z","email":"neno@promoatlas.com","name":"Neno PromoAtlas"},"message":"fix: Correct data transformation and add .gitignore\n\nThis commit addresses several issues, but some problems remain unresolved.\n\nChanges:\n- Added a .gitignore file to the frontend directory to exclude node_modules and other build artifacts.\n- Corrected the database configuration in the backend to prioritize the DATABASE_URL.\n- Refactored the Product type to match the Strapi API response structure.\n- Updated the ProductCard and ProductDetail components to use the new Product type.\n- Corrected the getBrands function in api.ts to handle the partial product data.\n\nUnresolved Issues:\n- The application still crashes with a ''TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ''main_image'')'' in the ProductCard component. This indicates a persistent issue with the data structure being passed to the component.\n- The ''Failed to fetch brands'' error is still present, which is likely related to the data structure issue.\n\nFurther investigation is needed to resolve these remaining issues.","tree":{"sha":"e520865105cf7efc288307cfd71ea76e3059b7d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/trees/e520865105cf7efc288307cfd71ea76e3059b7d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/commits/8613cae87bc7a251b6c6f320dd3fd3cca378bed2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/8613cae87bc7a251b6c6f320dd3fd3cca378bed2","node_id":"C_kwDOPJPRqtoAKDg2MTNjYWU4N2JjN2EyNTFiNmM2ZjMyMGRkM2ZkM2NjYTM3OGJlZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/913534b8a9dd3771d0afbba5964ec4a2f987993c","sha":"913534b8a9dd3771d0a