re":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/913534b8a9dd3771d0afbba5964ec4a2f987993c","node_id":"C_kwDOPJPRqtoAKDkxMzUzNGI4YTlkZDM3NzFkMGFmYmJhNTk2NGVjNGEyZjk4Nzk5M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/50393ec09d37e2e1c2c152cc2cb4f3951e9c9390","sha":"50393ec09d37e2e1c2c152cc2cb4f3951e9c9390","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/50393ec09d37e2e1c2c152cc2cb4f3951e9c9390"}],"sha":"913534b8a9dd3771d0afbba5964ec4a2f987993c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/913534b8a9dd3771d0afbba5964ec4a2f987993c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/50393ec09d37e2e1c2c152cc2cb4f3951e9c9390/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-12T11:43:03Z","email":"neno@promoatlas.com","name":"Neno PromoAtlas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-12T11:43:03Z","email":"neno@promoatlas.com","name":"Neno PromoAtlas"},"message":"🔧 Update Promidata sync configuration and clean up test files\n\n- Enhanced promidata-sync service functionality\n- Updated package dependencies\n- Cleaned up temporary R2 test files\n- Updated project status documentation\n- Modified plugin configurations","tree":{"sha":"aad8f41a2487c40b8ab6690295d3619af6b4c460","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/trees/aad8f41a2487c40b8ab6690295d3619af6b4c460"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/commits/50393ec09d37e2e1c2c152cc2cb4f3951e9c9390","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/50393ec09d37e2e1c2c152cc2cb4f3951e9c9390","node_id":"C_kwDOPJPRqtoAKDUwMzkzZWMwOWQzN2UyZTFjMmMxNTJjYzJjYjRmMzk1MWU5YzkzOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/fc89d0bf3fca76618a55d5fc2db1027117643338","sha":"fc89d0bf3fca76618a55d5fc2db1027117643338","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/fc89d0bf3fca76618a55d5fc2db1027117643338"}],"sha":"50393ec09d37e2e1c2c152cc2cb4f3951e9c9390","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/50393ec09d37e2e1c2c152cc2cb4f3951e9c9390"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/fc89d0bf3fca76618a55d5fc2db1027117643338/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-11T22:40:06Z","email":"neno@promoatlas.com","name":"Neno PromoAtlas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-11T22:40:06Z","email":"neno@promoatlas.com","name":"Neno PromoAtlas"},"message":"✨ Add Complete Image Upload & Enhanced Field Extraction\n\nThis commit implements comprehensive product synchronization with full image support:\n\n## 🖼️ Image Upload System\n- **uploadImageFromUrl()** method for downloading images from Promidata URLs\n- **Automatic upload** to Strapi media library with proper file handling\n- **Main image + gallery images** (up to 3) linked to products\n- **Graceful error handling** with detailed logging for failed uploads\n\n## 📊 Enhanced Field Extraction (16+ fields)\n- **Multilingual content**: name, description, material, color names (EN/DE/FR/NL)\n- **Multiple price tiers**: quantity-based pricing instead of single price\n- **Brand & geographic data**: brand, country of origin, customs tariff number\n- **Color information**: search color, PMS color codes, multilingual color names\n- **Product details**: EAN, supplier SKU, dimensions, weight\n- **Image references**: main_image and gallery_images fields\n\n## 🔧 Sync Improvements\n- **Product-level hash tracking** for efficient incremental updates\n- **Enhanced debug logging** for better troubleshooting\n- **Force update capability** for testing (deletes existing products)\n- **Comprehensive error handling** for each product processing step\n\n## 🧹 Code Cleanup\n- **Removed dashboard complexity** in favor of direct API approach\n- **Fixed TypeScript compilation errors** with proper type annotations\n- **Improved product code extraction** from multiple sources\n- **Added validation routes** for checking sync results\n\n## 📈 Performance\n- **Batch processing** with configurable limits\n- **Skip unchanged products** using hash comparison\n- **Limited gallery images** (3 max) for optimal performance\n- **Proper memory management** for large product catalogs\n\n🎯 **Result**: Successfully imported 5 products with full enhanced field extraction\nand image processing (imported:5, updated:0, skipped:0, errors:0)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aff3d12269bc1050b40f4ed998001d4659b9395d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/trees/aff3d12269bc1050b40f4ed998001d4659b9395d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/commits/fc89d0bf3fca76618a55d5fc2db1027117643338","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/fc89d0bf3fca76618a55d5fc2db1027117643338","node_id":"C_kwDOPJPRqtoAKGZjODlkMGJmM2ZjYTc2NjE4YTU1ZDVmYzJkYjEwMjcxMTc2NDMzMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/0fcd48b8673ce7c150329ff4cfe77cf50e01b7a8","sha":"0fcd48b8673ce7c150329ff4cfe77cf50e01b7a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/0fcd48b8673ce7c150329ff4cfe77cf50e01b7a8"}],"sha":"fc89d0bf3fca76618a55d5fc2db1027117643338","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/fc89d0bf3fca76618a55d5fc2db1027117643338"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commits/0fcd48b8673ce7c150329ff4cfe77cf50e01b7a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-11T21:38:30Z","email":"neno@promoatlas.com","name":"Neno PromoAtlas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-11T21:38:30Z","email":"neno@promoatlas.com","name":"Neno PromoAtlas"},"message":"🚀 Implement Product-Level Hash Sync for Promidata Integration\n\n✨ Features:\n- Individual product hash tracking for efficient incremental sync\n- Full Promidata Import.txt parsing with 1,414 products discovered for A23\n- Multilingual product data support (EN, DE, FR, NL)\n- Real-time sync dashboard with supplier management\n- Tested successfully with 5 A23 products imported\n\n🔧 Technical Updates:\n- Enhanced parseProductUrlsWithHashes() to use correct Import.txt URL\n- Updated extractProductCode() for Promidata JSON structure\n- Fixed product data mapping for JSON fields (name, description)\n- Added product-level hash comparison for change detection\n- Implemented proper TypeScript typing for multilingual content\n\n📊 Sync Results:\n- Processed: 5/5 products successfully\n- Imported: 5 new products with full data\n- Errors: 0\n- Hash tracking: Individual product-level MD5 hashes stored\n- Incremental sync: Ready for future change detection\n\n🎯 Next: Full production sync of all 1,414 A23 products\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f78a341574d9dbec431120fcc84854328ba0bf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/trees/9f78a341574d9dbec431120fcc84854328ba0bf0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/git/commits/0fcd48b8673ce7c150329ff4cfe77cf50e01b7a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/0fcd48b8673ce7c150329ff4cfe77cf50e01b7a8","node_id":"C_kwDOPJPRqtoAKDBmY2Q0OGI4NjczY2U3YzE1MDMyOWZmNGNmZTc3Y2Y1MGUwMWI3YTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neno73/PromovereAtlasPim/commit/1a4a1834599fa590f9