ulation Improvements:**\n- Enhanced algorithm to support both Rust and TypeScript/JavaScript patterns\n- Added cyclomatic complexity calculation for better accuracy\n- Support for multi-language codebases with proper pattern matching\n- Fixed threshold boundaries for Medium/High complexity classification\n\n**Test Infrastructure:**\n- Fix import paths for PathNormalizer and missing type imports\n- Update test files to use proper extensions (.js) for accurate analysis\n- Comprehensive test content for realistic complexity scoring\n\n**Results:**\n- ✅ 237/237 core tests passing (100% success rate)\n- ✅ Angular Components/Pipes/Services detection working\n- ✅ Rust file patterns (tests, benches, examples) working\n- ✅ Cross-platform path support (Windows/Unix)\n- ✅ Accurate complexity calculation for TypeScript and Rust\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dccfadc8e70ac5bb75a91f4a5f69499b91ca8c75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oriaj-nocrala/token-optimizer/git/trees/dccfadc8e70ac5bb75a91f4a5f69499b91ca8c75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oriaj-nocrala/token-optimizer/git/commits/1519316a5d2acfa522d4e0b223c3a6b2f4632679","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110201852?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriaj-nocrala/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriaj-nocrala/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriaj-nocrala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriaj-nocrala/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oriaj-nocrala","id":110201852,"login":"oriaj-nocrala","node_id":"U_kgDOBpGL_A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriaj-nocrala/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriaj-nocrala/received_even