"chethangopal8867@gmail.com","name":"chethan0407"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T10:46:40Z","email":"chethangopal8867@gmail.com","name":"chethan0407"},"message":"dev: Vite 5 ESM config, reliable Tailwind/CSS, and explicit API origin\n\nSummary\n- Primary Vite config is vite.config.mjs (plain ESM). vite.config.ts now only\n  re-exports it so tooling stays aligned with a single source of truth.\n- Tailwind and Autoprefixer run via css.postcss.plugins in Vite so @tailwind\n  and @apply compile consistently in dev and production. Root postcss.config.js\n  was removed to avoid duplicate or missed PostCSS discovery.\n- Browser API base: new src/config/api.ts with resolveApiUrl(). In development\n  the default origin is http://localhost:8000 (override with VITE_API_ORIGIN).\n  Production keeps relative /api unless VITE_API_ORIGIN is set. Wired into\n  auth store, api-client (including redirect Location handling), and\n  authenticatedFetch.\n- Dependencies/scripts: Vite 5, @vitejs/plugin-vue 5, dev server on 5177 with\n  /api proxy target configurable via env; lockfile and helper scripts updated.\n- DX: env.d.ts (VITE_API_ORIGIN), .env.example, DEV_SERVER_GUIDE.md,\n  tsconfig.node.json includes vite.config.mjs, metadata store fetch timeout and\n  clearer errors, .vscode/extensions.json.\n\nRollback\n- Revert this commit: git revert HEAD\n- Inspect this commit: git show HEAD\n\nNotes\n- Backend must allow CORS from the dev UI origin when using direct :8000 calls.\n- If styles break after revert, restore postcss.config.* with tailwindcss and\n  autoprefixer, or keep vite.config.mjs css.postcss as in this commit.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"81ddc0d85467ba055fe7a72d493321e4445e4a10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chethan0407/Taper_feature_2nd_FE/git/trees/81ddc0d85467ba055fe7a72d493321e4445e4a10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chethan0407/Taper_feature_2nd_FE/git/commits/855dbb3787c039c5e39fcb7e55d1509d880b4525","verification":{"payload"